{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take and move it to destination. Then check property. Do task or return object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectPropertyTrue    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ReturnObject    />\"",
