    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectPropertyTrue? THEN\n\t\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIF IsInCorrectLocation? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDO DoSpecificTask\n\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\t\tDO ReturnObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
